%% description: The revised checkout in order: the API answers at once and the worker charges once.
sequenceDiagram
  participant web as Web App
  participant api as Orders API
  participant db as Orders Database
  participant queue as Job Queue
  participant worker as Payment Worker
  participant provider as Payment Provider
  web->>api: POST /orders
  api->>db: Save order
  api->>queue: Capture job
  api-->>web: 202 Accepted
  queue->>worker: Next job
  worker->>provider: Charge, with idempotency key
  provider-->>worker: Captured
  worker->>db: Record result
